    "copyright_p1": "Copyright © 2026 Stefano Indraccolo.",
    "copyright_p2": "ED:Event2Led is source-available software, not open source. Its source code is published under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0: you may read, run, modify and share it for any noncommercial purpose. Commercial use is not allowed.",
    "copyright_p3": "Using the app while streaming or recording your gameplay, including on monetized channels, is allowed. The name and icon identify the original project: a modified version must use a different name. Official builds are published only at github.com/leandor70/EDEvent2Led/releases.",
